      <JapaneseText>アセリア暦4408年
（&lt;Dio&gt;、&lt;Mel&gt;の時代）に飛べる
ふたりの似顔絵だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's the Portrait of the Twins. From
here you can travel to A.C. 4408,
the time &lt;Dio&gt; &amp; &lt;Mel&gt; are from.</EnglishText>
